| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach mac [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
```### Validate field values ###```
| eval mac=mvfilter(match(mac, "^([0-9a-f]{2}:){5}[0-9a-f]{2}$"))
```### Eval expression fields ###```
| eval label = upper(owner) . "-" . priority
```### Keep only the columns the merge uses ###```
| fields _time, source, source_lookup, priority, mac, label
```### Build match keys (lowercased where the field is case insensitive) ###```
| eval adbk_mac = mac
```### Remove blocklisted values from the match keys ###```
| eval `adb_key_blocklist_cs(adbk_mac)`
```### Shallow merge assets with matching key fields (using basic stats) ###```
| eval _key = adbk_mac
| search _key=*
```### Tag multivalue values with their time (so the most recent ones can be kept) ###```
| eval `adb_tag_time(mac)`
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, values(adbk_mac) as adbk_mac, latest(priority) as priority, values(mac) as mac by _key
```### Deep merge assets with matching key fields (using custom command) ###```
| eval _key = adbk_mac
```### Merge: only the keys go through adbmerge, the result is joined back by row id ###```
| `adb_merge(25, 50)`
```### Clusters that were too large to merge go to assetdb_overflow for review, not into assetdb ###```
| `adb_save_overflow`
| where isnull(adb_overflow)
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, `adb_counters`, latest(priority) as priority, values(mac) as mac by _key
```### Newest values first: sort, de-duplicate and strip the time prefix ###```
| eval `adb_newest_first(mac)`
```### Fill null values (after the merge, only where an asset has no value at all) ###```
| eval priority = if(isnull(priority), "3", priority)
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval mac = mvindex(mac,0,4)
```### Run safety: how many assets did the last successful run produce? ###```
| `adb_run_guard(0.5)`
```### Record this run in assetdb_runs (the last 200 runs are kept) ###```
| `adb_record_run(0.5, 200)`
```### Only write the asset database when the run passed the safety check ###```
| `adb_write_gate`
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, priority, mac, label
| outputlookup override_if_empty=false assetdb
